{
      "id": "kele_reading",
      "name": "可乐阅读",
      "author": "@codex",
      "repo": "",
      "keys": [
        "keleCookieList",
        "kele_ql_url",
        "kele_ql_client_id",
        "kele_ql_client_secret",
        "kele_update_interval",
        "kele_bypass_interval_check",
        "auto_sync_kele_ql",
        "kele_default_remark",
        "kele_ql_token",
        "kele_ql_token_expires",
        "kele_ql_token_fingerprint"
      ],
      "descs_html": [
        "<h4 align=\"center\">微信内打开可乐阅读页面即可自动抓取 udtauth40 并同步到青龙</h4>",
        "<p>青龙变量：<b>kele_auth</b>，每个账号一行，固定格式“备注#凭证”（备注允许为空，即 #凭证）。</p>",
        "<p>青龙连接参数使用独立前缀 <b>kele_ql_*</b>，不会与京东同步脚本的 ql_* 冲突，可指向另一台青龙。</p>",
        "<p>安装 kele_cookie_sync.snippet 生效；青龙面板需开放 OpenAPI 应用（Client ID / Client Secret）。</p>"
      ],
      "settings": [
        {
          "id": "kele_ql_url",
          "name": "青龙面板地址",
          "val": "",
          "type": "text",
          "placeholder": "http://192.168.1.100:5700",
          "desc": "青龙面板的完整地址，如 http://192.168.1.100:5700"
        },
        {
          "id": "kele_ql_client_id",
          "name": "青龙 Client ID",
          "val": "",
          "type": "text",
          "placeholder": "请输入 Client ID",
          "desc": "在青龙面板系统设置-应用设置中创建应用后获取"
        },
        {
          "id": "kele_ql_client_secret",
          "name": "青龙 Client Secret",
          "val": "",
          "type": "text",
          "placeholder": "请输入 Client Secret",
          "desc": "在青龙面板系统设置-应用设置中创建应用后获取"
        },
        {
          "id": "auto_sync_kele_ql",
          "name": "自动同步",
          "val": true,
          "type": "boolean",
          "desc": "关闭后仅保留手动同步"
        },
        {
          "id": "kele_update_interval",
          "name": "同步间隔（秒）",
          "val": "1800",
          "type": "text",
          "placeholder": "1800",
          "desc": "按账号各自独立计时。某账号在间隔内的命中会直接结束（不推送），其它账号不受影响"
        },
        {
          "id": "kele_default_remark",
          "name": "默认备注",
          "val": "",
          "type": "text",
          "placeholder": "可不填",
          "desc": "备注按 昵称 → uid → 此处 顺序取；都为空时就是 #凭证，备注为空属正常情况"
        },
        {
          "id": "kele_bypass_interval_check",
          "name": "忽略同步间隔",
          "val": false,
          "type": "boolean",
          "desc": "打开后忽略上面的间隔限制，重写命中即抓包并同步；平时请保持关闭"
        },
        {
          "id": "keleCookieList",
          "name": "凭证列表",
          "val": "",
          "type": "textarea",
          "autoGrow": true,
          "rows": 5,
          "desc": "自动抓取存储的 udtauth40 列表（JSON 格式），一般无需手动编辑"
        }
      ]
    }
